---
title: "Reading by author"
description: "Every author I've read, with how many of their books and the order I read them in."
date: 2026-11-06
---

<p><a href="{{ '/reading/' | url }}">← Reading</a></p>

<p>{{ description }}</p>

{% set multi = [] %}
{% for author in collections.readingAuthors %}{% if author.books | length > 1 %}{% set multi = (multi.push(author), multi) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}

<p><strong>{{ collections.readingAuthors | length }} authors</strong>, {{ multi | length }} of them read more than once. Sorted by surname, with the most-read first below.</p>

<h2>Read more than once</h2>
<ul class="author-list">
  {% for author in multi | sort(true, false, "books.length") %}
    <li><a href="{{ ('/reading/authors/' + author.key + '/') | url }}">{{ author.name }}</a> <span class="author-list__count">{{ author.books | length }}</span></li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2>Everyone</h2>
<ul class="author-list">
  {% for author in collections.readingAuthors %}
    <li><a href="{{ ('/reading/authors/' + author.key + '/') | url }}">{{ author.name }}</a> <span class="author-list__count">{{ author.books | length }}</span></li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
